# The Archive

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root at the start of site or article work.

- Static Astro only. No SSR, `@astrojs/cloudflare`, or React unless the user asks.
- Never commit to `develop` or `main`. Branch → PR → CI → merge.
- Site: `feat/` `fix/` `design/` → PR `develop` → same branch PR `main`.
- Articles: `content/<slug>` from `develop`, `draft: true` → later that branch to `main`.
- Do not merge all of `develop` into `main` while drafts should stay off production.
- Cloudflare deploys on merge. `develop` is Preview, `main` is Production.
- Korean is the source edition. Share `translationKey`. Keep prose readable without JS.
- Agents retrieve; humans reread. Allow production crawlers. Never let bots write Useful/events. Do not add SSR or Bot Fight Mode to save money — static reads are cheap. Read `docs/AGENT_ACCESS.md`.
- Commit only when asked. Do not push or merge to `main` unless asked.
